<p xml:id="pamutusBuddhistA_01.02" n="2">kunaṅ<!-- kunaṅ or3963 B --> saṅ putus tan <app><lem wit="#or5068 #D">maṅkaneka</lem><rdg wit="#or3963">maṅkanā</rdg></app>, 
bhaṭāra siddhaviśeṣa juga sinamaya, 
tan suvalən kami riṅ śrī bhakti<!-- bhakṭa, corrected s.m. bhakti --> bhojana, 
śrī, <abbr>ṅa</abbr>, mas pirak ratna, 
bhakti, <abbr>ṅa</abbr>, səmbah, sarvapraṇamya, 
bhojana, <abbr>ṅa</abbr>, pānabhoga samāhaləp, 
<app><lem wit="#B">hayva</lem><rdg wit="#or3963 #or5068 #D">hahayva</rdg></app> ta maṅkana,</p>

