<p xml:id="pamutusBuddhistA_01.04" n="4">ləñok yan tan adravya kaharəp, 
yan tumarimaṅ śrī, 
ləñok yan tan kaviśeṣa riṅ<!-- or5068 ri --> lupa, 
yan tumarimaṅ bhakti, 
ləñok yan tan kavaśa deniṅ tamah, 
